<title>UK: JP Morgan sets warrants on European finance basket.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan sets warrants on European finance basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan &amp; Cie SA says it has issued 60,000 American-style call warrants, on a basket of European financials comprising AGF, Allianz, Banque Nationale de Paris, Commercial Union, Internationale Nederlanden Groep NV and Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10,000.00 FRF	   ISSUE PRICE  1,460.00 FRF</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   02.DEC.99		 PAYDATE	02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
